    "detailed_description": "Cook Fest is a combination of strategic planning, restaurant management, tower defense, and chaotic kitchen action. It creates some fresh gameplay in the market and extremely fun roguelite experiences unlike any other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are free to design your festival spaces!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.poster.avif?t=1694939043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.webm?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.mp4?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Creatively make your own maze layout</strong><br></li><li><strong>Customers will always find the shortest route to each checkpoints</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook dishes based on recipes &amp; ingredients you've unlocked!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.poster.avif?t=1694939043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.webm?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.mp4?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlocks new ingredients, recipes, customers and other contents as you progress</strong><br></li><li><strong>Be aware of customers allergic, dislikes &amp; loves</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combines &amp; upgrades!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You can combine ingredients &amp; appliances to make a new food/ingredients tables</strong><br></li><li><strong>Upgrades your utilities to automate things</strong><br></li><li><strong>Upgrades your serving tables to improve foods that you serves</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your strategy on each run!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Randomly generated basic map layouts and unexpected elements of Roguelite</strong><br></li><li><strong>You will get random ingredients, appliances &amp; utilities on each day</strong></li></ul><br><br><strong><u>[We are working hard to implement multiplayer system]</u></strong><br>Team up with your fellow chefs in chaotic kitchen co-op actions!<br><br><br><i><strong>How many days can you survive and maintain good ratings of your festival?</strong></i>",
    "about_the_game": "Cook Fest is a combination of strategic planning, restaurant management, tower defense, and chaotic kitchen action. It creates some fresh gameplay in the market and extremely fun roguelite experiences unlike any other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are free to design your festival spaces!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.poster.avif?t=1694939043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.webm?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/34329e4bf0653a8b5ffda90e807bc42f.mp4?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Creatively make your own maze layout</strong><br></li><li><strong>Customers will always find the shortest route to each checkpoints</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook dishes based on recipes &amp; ingredients you've unlocked!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.poster.avif?t=1694939043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.webm?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235210/extras/1b46d46ec5eb8a696dbff36b4d54f09e.mp4?t=1694939043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlocks new ingredients, recipes, customers and other contents as you progress</strong><br></li><li><strong>Be aware of customers allergic, dislikes &amp; loves</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combines &amp; upgrades!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You can combine ingredients &amp; appliances to make a new food/ingredients tables</strong><br></li><li><strong>Upgrades your utilities to automate things</strong><br></li><li><strong>Upgrades your serving tables to improve foods that you serves</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your strategy on each run!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Randomly generated basic map layouts and unexpected elements of Roguelite</strong><br></li><li><strong>You will get random ingredients, appliances &amp; utilities on each day</strong></li></ul><br><br><strong><u>[We are working hard to implement multiplayer system]</u></strong><br>Team up with your fellow chefs in chaotic kitchen co-op actions!<br><br><br><i><strong>How many days can you survive and maintain good ratings of your festival?</strong></i>",
    "short_description": "Cook Fest is a unique combination of tower defense and cooking genres. Create and design your own complex maze. Cook and serve dishes to satisfy your customers &amp; unlock new recipes. With unexpected roguelite elements &amp; fast-paced gameplay, you can play solo or in chaotic co-op with your fellow chef!",
